#
# golden.models — the AI models baked into the golden disc by
# build_system/mk_golden_disc.sh. Same line format as macos/models.manifest:
#
#   NAME.gguf  SHA256(64 hex)  BYTES  CID  LICENCE  URL...
#
# Every model here must be licensed for redistribution AND commercial use
# (36N9 Genetics may sell the OS). sha256 and size are copied from the
# upstream file, never invented; the URL pins an upstream commit so the file
# behind it cannot change. The builder refuses a download whose sha256 or size
# differs, and writes \ZXV\MODELS.SHA so the OS checks them again on the
# machine that boots the disc (kernel/src/hwdrv/hw_models.h). Which disc each
# model goes on: build_system/golden.core and build_system/golden.swarm.
#
# Not eligible: Qwen2.5-3B (Qwen Research licence, no commercial use) and
# Qwen2.5-72B (Qwen licence, user cap). 0.5B, 1.5B, 7B, 14B and 32B are Apache-2.0.

# Main model: the one ZXV's real-model tests use (bench/results/2026-10-10-qwen2.5-1.5b).
